message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "MOT Risk Index Evidence Capsule: Great Britain family and defect-group aggregates, 2024"
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: "Ivitskiy"
    given-names: "Igor"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-9749-6414"
    affiliation: "MOT Risk Index"
version: 2024-v2
date-released: 2026-08-23
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.22071425"
url: "https://motriskindex.co.uk/statistics/mot-failure-rates/"
license: CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >-
  This dataset publishes aggregated 2024 Great Britain MOT initial-test outcomes
  for 34 vehicle families. It provides age-adjusted family ratios and
  prespecified defect-group rates, excesses and over-representation ratios with
  disclosure-control thresholds; no vehicle-level or geographic records are included.
keywords:
  - MOT
  - vehicle inspection
  - DVSA
  - open data
  - Great Britain
